  "comparator_scope_note": "k=1 CONTRIBUTING, not a complete-evidence claim: EMPEROR-Preserved (NCT03057951) supplies the only EXTRACTABLE primary-outcome estimate here. This is NOT a claim that the eligible evidence base is a single trial -- 4 records screened in and 3 are declared absent for this pooled number. External audit identified EMPA-VISION (a randomised double-blind trial with a separate HFpEF cohort) as eligible and missed by the trial-level search; the cohort-level screening + concept-query rebuild is the fix. The nearest published synthesis pools the SGLT2-inhibitor CLASS (a broader, network-level PICO), so its larger k is a scope difference, not evidence this review failed to retrieve."
