docs\definition_audit.json:39:   "resolution": "EXCLUDED as non-cardiac population: COP-AF (non-cardiac surgery) is outside the protocol I2 cardiac-surgery population. The mismatch was a POPULATION mismatch, not a timepoint one — the earlier timepoint-relabel resolution fixed the wrong axis (external audit). No longer pooled.",
