docs\class_discovery.json:2: "_doc": "New-defect-CLASS discovery per cold audit. Mahmood's 'how far from finished' metric: the rate at which each audit finds a genuinely NEW class of error (vs recurrences of classes already diagnosed). A bending curve = approaching the class ceiling; the arithmetic is beyond reproach (engine reproduced 23/23..25/25 across audits 24-26), so every remaining class is a DESCRIPTION failure (the data sits correct one layer down while the framing over-claims). Counts for audits 22-25 are the auditor's stated figures; audit 26 is this session's classification. Earlier audits (1-21) predate this explicit tracking.",
