docs\class_discovery.json:83: "trend_note": "new-classes-per-audit 22->29: 3,3,2,1,2,1,1,0. The 0 at audit 29 is the first: an independent re-audit found nothing new. The residual is trial identity, publication linkage, complete retrieval, outcome harmonisation — not statistics."
