7;28745999&#x27;] recovered by the search and correctly EXCLUDED [&#x27;28745999&#x27;] by rule (same drug/design, wrong topic).</li></ul></section><section class="tab" id="tab-outcomes"><h3 class="tabname">Results</h3><h4>28-day all-cause mortality (primary)</h4><table class='kv'><tr><th>Estimand</th><td>OR</td></tr><tr><th>Analysis population</th><td>intention-to-treat</td></tr><tr><th>Timepoint</th><td>28 days</td></tr><tr><th>Method</th><td>Single included trial that reported this outcome — the estimate is that trial&#x27;s own effect; no random-effects pooling (tau^2, HKSJ and prediction interval are not applicable at k=1).</td></tr><tr><th>k</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Single-trial effect</th><td>0.83 (OR), 95% CI 0.73–0.95</td></tr><tr><th>Note</th><td>prediction interval undefined for k=1</td></tr><tr><th>Leave-one-out (influence)</th><td>not assessable at k=1 (leave-one-out needs k&amp;gt;=3)</td></tr></table><h5>Compatibility key (pooling contract)</h5><table class='kv'><tr><th>Effect-measure class</th><td>FIRST_EVENT_RATIO</td></tr><tr><th>Effect-measure labels pooled</th><td></td></tr><tr><th>Endpoint</th><td>single endpoint</td></tr><tr><th>Follow-up window</th><td>28 days</td></tr><tr><th>Analysis set</th><td>intention-to-treat</td></tr><tr><th>Randomised contrast (registry-confirmed)</th><td>1 of 1 pooled trials</td></tr></table><p class='note'>k = 1: the 1 trial(s) named below were pooled; 11 further screened-in trial(s) had no poolable value for this outcome and are listed below with an explicit <em>absence state</em>. These are four different things and only one is a claim about the trial: <em>no outcome data in source</em> (the full text was retrieved and is silent — the only state that means the trial itself lacks the outcome; 3 here) vs. <em>not extracted</em> (the number IS in the retrieved source — an extraction gap, about us, not the trial), <em>abstract only, full text not retrieved</em> (absence in the trial is unproven), and <em>excluded on evidence</em> (a number was found and deliberately not pooled — see reason). An unassessed outcome never counts as favourable to the intervention.</p><table class='arms'><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Id</th><th>Input</th><th>Source</th></tr><tr><td>33933206</td><td>PMID 33933206</td><td>621/2022 vs 729/2094 (events/n) <span class='muted' title='effect computed by the harness from arm-level data, not the trial-reported effect'>· harness-reconstructed</span></td><td><span class='vok' title='arm counts present in committed source'>✓ verified against source</span><br>abstract arm-level counts (percentage-corroborated): Overall, 621 (31%) of the 2022 patients allocated tocilizumab and 729 (35%) of the 2094 patients allocated to usual care died within 28 days (rate ratio 0.85; 95% CI 0.76-0.94; p=0.0028).<div class='ident'><em>design key:</em> UNKNOWN / unit UNKNOWN; estimator RECONSTRUCTED; correlation handling none; action ALLOW_WITH_LABEL</div></td></tr><tr><td>40232661</td><td>PMID 40232661</td><td class='absent-cell'>declared absent — no outcome data in the retrieved source</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>38157348</td><td>PMID 38157348</td><td class='absent-cell'>not extracted — the outcome&#x27;s number IS in the source (extraction gap, not trial absence)</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>34609549</td><td>PMID 34609549</td><td class='absent-cell'>not extracted — the outcome&#x27;s number IS in the source (extraction gap, not trial absence)</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>33631066</td><td>PMID 33631066</td><td class='absent-cell'>not extracted — the outcome&#x27;s number IS in the source (extraction gap, not trial absence)</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr