docs\evidence\decoupling-universal-2026-09-15\README.md.html:7:**32 of 32 topics** carried at least one BLOCKS_CLAIM or QUALIFIES_CLAIM hazard that was detected, rendered for the reader, and routed to no analytic decision (421 hazard objects). Crystalloids (SMART/SALT/SPLIT pooled under a cluster-crossover caveat with every compatibility key MATCH) was the instance the auditor found; the corpus state was the rule. This is the strongest confirmation that the mechanism -- disclosure-as-control -- is real and general, not an instance they happened to construct.
