docs\reviews\colchicine-postop-af\review.json:1716:  "evidence_base_caveat": "The cardiac-surgery evidence base here is incomplete. This pool removes the non-cardiac contamination (COP-AF and Bessissow, excluded as thoracic / lung-resection surgery), but the PubMed search is still an enumerated PMID query, not a concept query, so cardiac-surgery colchicine trials it never searched for (such as the original COPPS trial) are still missing. The pooled estimate should therefore be read as 'contamination removed' and provisional, NOT as the stronger, more precise benefit a complete cardiac-surgery meta-analysis reports; it will change when the search is rebuilt as a concept query.",
