ser&quot;,&quot;user_view_type&quot;:&quot;public&quot;,&quot;site_admin&quot;:false},&quot;jobs_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/runs/34775559625/jobs&quot;,&quot;logs_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/runs/34775559625/logs&quot;,&quot;check_suite_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/check-suites/94180692317&quot;,&quot;artifacts_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/runs/34775559625/artifacts&quot;,&quot;cancel_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/runs/34775559625/cancel&quot;,&quot;rerun_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/runs/34775559625/rerun&quot;,&quot;previous_attempt_url&quot;:null,&quot;workflow_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/repos/mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness/actions/workflows/355794204&quot;,&quot;head_commit&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;109053ad175eafcb77c0c23020f8e367008591c4&quot;,&quot;tree_id&quot;:&quot;da9708db8631edd53be45ad558d2c92ba2367666&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:&quot;extract: match mortality&lt;-&gt;death synonym so Torres pools into corticosteroids-CAP\n\n_outcome_sentences enumerated &#x27;in-hospital death&#x27; but Torres 2015 (PMID 25688779)\nreports its secondary as &#x27;in-hospital mortality&#x27;, so no keyword was a substring and\nthe trial was declared-absent -- an all-cause-mortality RCT dropped on a pure\nsynonym gap. Phrase keywords naming death/mortality now also match the swapped\nsynonym (&#x27;in-hospital death&#x27; &lt;-&gt; &#x27;in-hospital mortality&#x27;); bare tokens (&#x27;died&#x27;) are\nNOT broadened, and Torres&#x27;s primary treatment-failure composite (8/61 vs 18/59, no\ndeath/mortality word) stays correctly unselected.\n\nGeneral across every mortality topic. Corpus effect is surgical: exactly one topic\nmoves. corticosteroids-cap-mortality all-cause mortality k=1 -&gt; k=2 (adds Torres\n6/61 vs 9/59), RR 0.525 (0.33-0.836, significant) -&gt; RR 0.546 (0.036-8.26, NOT\nsignificant): the point estimate barely moves but the honest k=2 HKSJ interval (t1)\nno longer excludes no-effect. The move is toward the null -- the previous k=1\n&#x27;significant benefit&#x27; was overconfident precisely because it omitted a trial.\n\nDenominator audit (owed): verified already-correct, no change needed -- SELECT\nAE-discontinuation 718/8801 (placebo N right), semaglutide-weight 1306/655 &amp;\n407/204, LoDoCo2 MACE uses source HR (no reconstructed count denominator).\n\nRegression: tests/test_mortality_death_synonym.py (real cached Torres record + spec):\npositive synonym match, binds mortality not treatment-failure, bare token not\nbroadened, both swap directions. Full suite 312 passing; 32/32 reproduce.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) &lt;noreply@anthropic.com&gt;&quot;,&quot;timestamp&quot;:&quot;2026-09-13T18:43:42Z&quot;,&quot;author&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;mahmood726-cyber&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;mahmood726@gmail.com&quot;},&quot;committer&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;mahmood726-cyber&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;mahmood726@gmail.com&quot;}},&quot;repository&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:1364922793,&quot;node_id&quot;:&quot;R_kgDOUVsRqQ&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;meta-harness&quot;,&quot;full_name&quot;:&quot;mahmood726-cyber/meta-harness&quot;,&quot;private&quot;:false,&quot;owner&quot;:{&quot;login&quot;:&quot;mahmood726-cyber&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:227387868,&quot;node_id&quot;:&quot;U_kgDODY2p3A&quot;,&quot;avatar_url&quot;:&quot;https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227387868?v=4&quot;,&quot;gravatar_id&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/users/mahmood726-cyber&quot;,&quot;html_url&quot;:&quot;https://github.com/mahmood726-cyber&quot;,&quot;followers_url&quot;:&quot;https://api.github.com/users/mahmood726-cyber/followers&quot;,&quot;following_u