on gap, not trial absence)</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr></table></section><section class="tab" id="tab-harms"><h3 class="tabname">Harms</h3><h4>Gastrointestinal adverse events</h4><div class="absent"><strong>DECLARED ABSENT.</strong> REPORTED but not extractable as a pooled value: 31185157, 27295427, 34215025 mention this outcome in the committed abstract, but without arm counts or an effect+CI in an extractable form (e.g. a bare percentage with no denominator). This outcome is NOT absent — it is reported-but-not-poolable from the committed source; full-text acquisition would recover the countable form.</div><table class='arms'><tr><th>Trial</th><th>Id</th><th>Input</th><th>Source</th></tr><tr><td>31185157</td><td>PMID 31185157</td><td class='absent-cell'>not established — abstract only; full text not retrieved, so absence in the trial is unproven</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>27633186</td><td>PMID 27633186</td><td class='absent-cell'>not established — abstract only; full text not retrieved, so absence in the trial is unproven</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>27295427</td><td>PMID 27295427</td><td class='absent-cell'>not extracted — the outcome&#x27;s number IS in the source (extraction gap, not trial absence)</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>34215025</td><td>PMID 34215025</td><td class='absent-cell'>not established — abstract only; full text not retrieved, so absence in the trial is unproven</td><td>no percentage-corroborated arm counts or effect+CI for this outcome found in the abstract</td></tr><tr><td>31189511</td><td>PMID 31189511</td><td class='absent-cell'>not established — abstract only; full text not retrieved, so absence in the trial i