 R, Murphy C, et al., Practical comparison of the BioFire FilmArray pneumonia panel to routine diagnostic methods and potential impact on antimicrobial stewardship in adult hospitalized patients with lower respiratory tract infections. Journal of clinical microbiology. 2020 Jun 24;58(7):10-128.","DOI":"10.1128\/JCM.00135-20"},{"key":"2026052009414877334_j_pneum-2025-0027_ref_015","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"McHugh LC, Snyder K, Yager TD. The effect of uncertainty in patient classification on diagnostic performance estimations. PLoS One. 2019;14: e0217146. doi:10.1371\/JOURNAL. PONE.0217146","DOI":"10.1371\/journal.pone.0217146"},{"key":"2026052009414877334_j_pneum-2025-0027_ref_016","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Jain S, Self WH, Wunderink RG, Fakhran S, Balk R, Bramley AM, et al. Community-acquired pneumonia requiring hospitalization among U.S. adults. The New England Journal of Medicine. 2015;373: 415\u2013427. doi:10.1056\/NEJMOA1500245","DOI":"10.1056\/NEJMoa1500245"},{"key":"2026052009414877334_j_pneum-2025-0027_ref_017","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Kuypers J, Loeffelholz MJ. Impact of rapid molecular detection of respiratory viruses on clinical outcomes and patient management. Journal of Clinical Microbiology. 2019;57: 1890\u20131908. doi:10.1128\/JCM.01890-18","DOI":"10.1128\/JCM.01890-18"},{"key":"2026052009414877334_j_pneum-2025-0027_ref_018","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Zhou F, Wang Y, Liu Y, Liu X, Gu L, Zhang X, et al. Disease severity and clinical outcomes of community-acquired pneumonia caused by non-influenza respiratory viruses in adults: a multicentre prospective registry study from the CAP-China Network. The European Respiratory Journal. 2019;54: 1802406. doi:10.1183\/13993003.02406-2018","DOI":"10.1164\/ajrccm-conference.2019.199.1_MeetingAbstracts.A4212"},{"key":"2026052009414877334_j_pneum-2025-0027_ref_019","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Alimi Y, Lim WS, Lansbury L, Le